        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 2364, Modern Mortise Lockset With Skylab Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Mortise Skylab Lever Lockset is a minimalist mortise door entryset. It comes packaged with the Omnia #364 lever with modern rosette, deadbolt, mortise lock, and all the necessary strikes and mounting hardware. This Modern Mortise Lockset With Skylab Lever is suitable for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-1/2 inch backsets of 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 2000 Series Modern Lever Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 2364 Mortise Lock with Modern Rose Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Projection: 3/8</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n   <ul>\r\n   <li>2-1⁄2” backset with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n   <li>2-3⁄4” backset with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n   </ul>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike. 4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever inside and by key outside. The outside lever is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Mortise Skylab Lever Lockset",
                "description": "The Modern Mortise Skylab Lever Lockset is a minimalist mortise door entryset. It comes packaged with the Omnia #364 lever with modern rosette, deadbolt, mortise lock, and all the necessary strikes and mounting hardware. This Modern Mortise Lockset With Skylab Lever is suitable for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-1/2 inch backsets of 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
